# Row-level BI extracts are regenerable build artifacts: these three are
# 138MB of the ~141MB that outputs/tableau weighs. The nine summary marts
# beside them total ~2.9MB and ARE committed, so a reviewer can read every
# result without building anything. olist/export.py records which is which
# in manifest.json, so a missing file here is explicable rather than odd.
outputs/tableau/mart_order_fact.csv
outputs/tableau/mart_customer_rfm.csv
outputs/tableau/mart_freight_economics.csv
